ith the project. The software is provided “as is,” without warranties, to the extent permitted by applicable law. This does not remove rights that cannot lawfully be excluded.</p><h2>Project information</h2><p>Learn about the purpose, technology, and project team on the <a href="<?= e(url('/about')) ?>">About BrainLoop</a> page. This project does not claim an institutional affiliation.</p></article></section>
